[For "white"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "giuoco-main 5.d3"]
[Name "Giuoco Piano: Black plays ...h6 first"]

5... h6 { Rules out Bg5 and Ng5 before anything else. It is safe enough, but it develops nothing, so White simply carries on. }
6. O-O { The same move as ever: castle before anything opens. }
6... d6 7. Re1 { Guards e4 a second time and frees the knight on f3. }
7... O-O { The position of the line where Black castles first: 8.h3 comes next. } *
